 aughs Australia series’ and has been seen as a recurring guest on Ten’
 s Celebrity Name Game and Studio Ten.As well as being a headliner in his ow
 n right in the USA\, UK and Australia\, Amos has performed at the Sydney O
 pera House and in multiple countries touring with Jim Jefferies\, includin
 g opening for him on his Australian and South African arena tours and at Ne
 w York’s iconic Madison Square Garden to a sell-out crowd. In 2022 Amos
